{"version":1,"content":"<p>天后莫文蔚（Karen）尋晚（22日）現身中環活動，剛與德籍老公共度結婚15周年嘅佢獲老公鮮有露面同行，更大方手拖手合照，大晒閃光彈。</p><p>Karen受訪時談到狀態好，佢甜笑：「當然啦，因為我有愛情滋潤！</p><p>剛剛先15周年，但不嬲都好似初戀，仲係16</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T02:25:21.355409+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:20:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T02:18:02.770699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T02:18:02.770699+00:00","content_hash":"44b0833ec42ca1a8b379ff55100637e5e5ba11a4fdc7ed1731bb9605dcacff06","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}